    "<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目比前面的理解檢查更具挑戰性，涵蓋能源轉換、化學史、科學模型與社會議題。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">先自行作答，答案與解析保留至回答後提供。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 1 題｜多階段能源轉換</strong></h3>某系統使用電力製氫、儲氫，再透過燃料電池發電。已知三階段效率分別為 80%、75%、60%，最初輸入 500 kJ。<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">(1) 計算最後輸出的電能（kJ）。\n(2) 若某種直接儲電方案整體效率為 85%，比較兩者的輸出電能。\n(3) 能否僅依效率判斷哪種技術在所有情境下都較值得使用？說明理由。</p><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\"><textarea data-d-component=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"在這裡寫下你的答案與判斷……\" id=\"_r_h5_\" class=\"Textarea-Q0w3LU\" rows=\"3\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\"></textarea></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查此題</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\">",
    "<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 2 題｜能源與環境</strong></h3>某地計畫以再生能源取代部分燃煤發電，居民提出下列四個主張。<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">A. 改用再生能源就不必再評估土地或生態影響。\nB. 發電時不燃燒化石燃料，不代表生命週期完全零排放。\nC. 太陽光電的裝置容量等於其每小時必然能產出的電量。\nD. 使用再生能源時，仍可能需要儲能及電網調度。\n請選出所有正確主張，並指出其餘主張的關鍵錯誤。</p><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\"><textarea data-d-component=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"在這裡寫下你的答案與判斷……\" id=\"_r_h9_\" class=\"Textarea-Q0w3LU\" rows=\"3\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\"></textarea></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查此題</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 3 題｜赫斯定律與能源</strong></h3>在相同指定條件下，已知反應：① C(s) + O₂(g) → CO₂(g)，ΔH₁ = −394 kJ；② CO(g) + ½O₂(g) → CO₂(g)，ΔH₂ = −283 kJ。<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">(1) 求 C(s) + ½O₂(g) → CO(g) 的焓變。\n(2) 說明為什麼能利用這兩條反應求出答案。\n(3) 如果把反應②反向書寫，其 ΔH 應如何變化？</p><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\"><textarea data-d-component=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"在這裡寫下你的答案與判斷……\" id=\"_r_hd_\" class=\"Textarea-Q0w3LU\" rows=\"3\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\"></textarea></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\">",
    "<button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查此題</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 4 題｜科學模型與證據</strong></h3>某科學家提出模型甲，能解釋目前觀察到的五種現象。後來發現第六種現象與模型甲的預測不符，另一模型乙則能解釋六種現象。<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">(1) 能否因此判斷模型甲在原先五種情境下必然完全無效？\n(2) 應如何設計或尋找進一步證據，評估模型乙的可靠性？\n(3) 舉出一個化學史上模型因新證據而修正的實際例子。</p><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\"><textarea data-d-component=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"在這裡寫下你的答案與判斷……\" id=\"_r_hh_\" class=\"Textarea-Q0w3LU\" rows=\"3\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\"></textarea></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查此題</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\">",
    "<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 5 題｜臺灣能源政策判讀</strong></h3>某公司宣稱：「本公司能源技術的發電階段不直接排放 CO₂，因此可以證明它是對臺灣最好的能源方案。」<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">(1) 這段論述具有哪一項科學上的優點或事實基礎？\n(2) 它缺乏哪些必要的證據？至少提出四項。\n(3) 如果你負責評估這項技術，會如何建立公平的比較基準？\n(4) 哪些因素屬於科學與技術判斷，哪些還涉及法律、倫理或社會價值？</p><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\"><textarea data-d-component=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"在這裡寫下你的答案與判斷……\" id=\"_r_hl_\" class=\"Textarea-Q0w3LU\" rows=\"3\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\"></textarea></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查此題</span></button></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div>"
